Date:   Sat Apr 25 01:59:07 2015 -0400

    WIP revamp of MapReduce-based index management

    This commit has two main objectives:

    * Rewrite the user-facing API for configuring and submitting reindex
      or index-removal MapReduce jobs so that all MapReduce job
      functionality is hidden behind an `updateIndex` method with a
      signature identical to that in TitanManagement.  Only the
      implementation differs.  Compare with the old user-facing API that
